\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"His parents, though skeptical at first, soon recognized their son's passion and encouraged him to pursue his dreams.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Frédéric's big break came when he was scouted by a local Belgian club, where he honed his skills and developed a reputation as a skilled midfielder.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"However, it wasn't until he made the bold decision to cross the border into France that his career truly took off.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"In 2018, Frédéric signed with Nîmes Olympique, a club with a rich history in French football.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Founded in 1937, Nîmes Olympique has a loyal fan base and a commitment to developing young talent.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"For Frédéric, the opportunity to play for the club was a dream come true.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"As he settled into his new surroundings, Frédéric quickly became an integral part of the team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"His vision on the pitch, combined with his tireless work ethic, made him a favorite among the coaching staff and fans alike.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"In his debut season, he made 25 appearances, scoring 3 goals and providing 5 assists.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"But Frédéric's success wasn't limited to his on-field performances.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"He also became an ambassador for the club, engaging with the local community and participating in charity events.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"His dedication to the team and its fans earned him the respect and admiration of everyone associated with Nîmes Olympique.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Frédéric's affiliation with Nîmes Olympique is his inclusion in the team's official squad list for the 2019-2020 season.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"According to the club's website, Frédéric is listed as a midfielder, with his name and photo appearing alongside his teammates.\"}]}"
